{"channelId":"UCaPre3qdx29dqFmhUzEvrHg","row":["Golden Oldies Cat Rescue",177,"Golden Oldies Cat Rescue is a 501c3 nonprofit. We are a resource and advocate for cats ages 6 and older residing in Monterey County, CA, whose guardians can no longer care for them or who are at risk in local shelters. When cats are surrendered to us, they live in our volunteer foster homes until we find permanent loving adoptive homes for them. Call us at (831) 200-9232, email us at info@gocatrescue.org or go to our website at www.gocatrescue.org.","info@gocatrescue.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaPre3qdx29dqFmhUzEvrHg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaPre3qdx29dqFmhUzEvrHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:21.102Z","channelId":"UCaPre3qdx29dqFmhUzEvrHg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ef8ec0e9bc1e4a3ed66c3caa74505ab576b3e121dbd4d04971019e2a7cf0389e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"9b17c09baf02a8f50efd4def0d14eb518b1db96d5a1ff83e9c348a1acd9ba678"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaPre3qdx29dqFmhUzEvrHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:21.102Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaPre3qdx29dqFmhUzEvrHg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":177,"raw":"177 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaPre3qdx29dqFmhUzEvrHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:21.102Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@gocatrescue.org","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaPre3qdx29dqFmhUzEvrHg"],"evidenceIds":["completion:d983c518fd85812aa218118f"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:21.102Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"s are surrendered to us, they live in our volunteer foster homes until we find permanent loving adoptive homes for them. Call us at (831) 200-9232, email us at info@gocatres